      en: ["The province contains over 43 million olive trees.", "Founded in the 16th century by Sultan Moulay Ismail.", "Located in the fertile Tessaout River plain.", "Largest producer of olive oil in all of Morocco.", "The Hassan I Dam provides essential irrigation water.", "Famous for its large livestock market held on Mondays."],
